                "text": "Recently, I had the opportunity to tour Dockside Health and Rehab Center in Locust Hill. It was great to meet with employees from Dockside Health and Saber Healthcare Group to discuss how they work to support fellow Virginians. I was able to share my work in support of seniors - from preserving critical programs like Medicare, Medicaid and Social Security.",
